<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said on Friday it would auction 3.0 billion pesos worth of Cetes at its primary auction on Tuesday next week.</p>
<p>It will also auction 900 million pesos worth of Bondes and 500 million UDIs of UDI bonds.</p>
<p>CETES</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    28  days     800 million pesos  19.73 pct</p>
<p>    91  days     800 million pesos  20.16 pct</p>
<p>    181 days     800 million pesos  19.22 pct</p>
<p>    343 days     600 million pesos  18.30 pct</p>
<p>BONDES</p>
<p>    728 days     900 million pesos  100.0 pct</p>
<p>UDIBONOS</p>
<p>    1,050 days   250 million UDIs    99.99060</p>
<p>    1,778 days   250 million UDIs    99.99060</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-7902))</p>
</text>
